  "Software Details": "Softwaredetails",
  "Gone are the days of tedious, time-consuming shopping experiences. With Bundle Products, we redefine convenience by bringing together all your essential items into one comprehensive package. Whether you are looking to revamp your wardrobe, upgrade your skincare routine, or stock up on household essentials, our bundles offer everything you need in one convenient click. Say goodbye to endless scrolling and hello to streamlined shopping experiences.": "Vorbei sind die Zeiten mühsamer und zeitraubender Einkaufserlebnisse. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Live-Demo ansehen",
  "Maximize Savings, Minimize Hassle": "Maximieren Sie die Einsparungen, minimieren Sie den Aufwand",
  "Saving money has never been easier with our Bundle Product module. By bundling products together, we unlock exclusive discounts and promotions that allow you to maximize your savings with every purchase. Why pay full price for individual items when you can enjoy significant discounts by bundling? Say goodbye to buyer is remorse and hello to smart, savvy shopping.": "Mit unserem Bundle-Produktmodul war es noch nie so einfach, Geld zu sparen. ",
  "Tailored to Perfection": "Maßgeschneidert auf Perfektion",
  "We understand that every shopper has unique preferences and needs. That is why our Bundle Product module empowers you to customize your bundles to perfection. Mix and match your favorite products, choose your preferred sizes and colors, and create a bundle that is tailor-made just for you. Whether you are curating the perfect gift set or treating yourself to a well-deserved indulgence, our customizable options ensure that you get exactly what you want, every time.": "Wir verstehen, dass jeder Käufer einzigartige Vorlieben und Bedürfnisse hat. ",
  "Discover Endless Possibilities": "Entdecken Sie endlose Möglichkeiten",
  "With Bundle Products, shopping becomes an adventure filled with endless possibilities. Each bundle presents an opportunity to explore new products, discover hidden gems, and indulge in exciting surprises. From deluxe beauty sets to curated culinary collections, our bundles offer a curated selection of products that are sure to delight and inspire. Who knows? You might just stumble upon your new favorite product with every bundle purchase.": "Mit Bundle-Produkten wird Einkaufen zu einem Abenteuer voller endloser Möglichkeiten. ",
